msgid "The app is installed only for you."
msgstr "Rakendus paigaldatakse ainult sinule."

#: appinstaller.rs:952
msgid "The AppImage is moved to {folder} and added to your apps."
msgstr "AppImage teisaldatakse kausta {folder} ja lisatakse sinu rakenduste hulka."

#: appinstaller.rs:958
msgid "Keep After MAN Updates"
msgstr "Säilita pärast MAN-i uuendusi"

#: appinstaller.rs:959
msgid "MAN installs the app again after each update. Its package files are kept for that."
msgstr "MAN paigaldab rakenduse pärast iga uuendust uuesti. Selleks hoitakse alles selle paketifailid."

#: appinstaller.rs:967
msgid "Click Install to install {name}."
msgstr "Rakenduse {name} paigaldamiseks klõpsa nupul Paigalda."

