msgid "Also installs the packages it needs: {list}"
msgstr "Paigaldab ka vajalikud paketid: {list}"

#: appinstaller.rs:989
msgid "Some packages the app needs are not available yet. Installing gets the newest package lists first; if they are still missing, the app cannot be installed."
msgstr "Mõned rakenduse vajatud paketid pole veel saadaval. Paigaldamine hangib esmalt uusimad paketiloendid; kui need ikka puuduvad, ei saa rakendust paigaldada."

#: appinstaller.rs:1050
msgid "Installing {name}…"
msgstr "Rakenduse {name} paigaldamine…"

