msgstr "Live-seanss taaskäivitub valitud keeles ja MAN paigaldatakse selles keeles."

#: installer.rs:213
msgid "Welcome to MAN"
msgstr "Tere tulemast MAN-i"

#: installer.rs:214
msgid ""
"A fast, open and fully customizable GNOME system.\n"
"Install it on this computer, or keep exploring the live session."
msgstr ""
"Kiire, avatud ja täielikult kohandatav GNOME süsteem.\n"
"Paigalda see sellesse arvutisse või jätka live-seansi avastamist."

#: installer.rs:218
msgid "_Install MAN…"
msgstr "_Paigalda MAN…"

#: installer.rs:220
msgid "_Keep Trying MAN"
msgstr "_Jätka MAN-i proovimist"

#: installer.rs:223
msgid "Looking for disks…"
msgstr "Ketaste otsimine…"

#: installer.rs:250
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Tere tulemast"

#: installer.rs:265
msgid "This computer was started in legacy BIOS mode. MAN can only be installed on UEFI computers: restart and choose the UEFI boot option."
msgstr "See arvuti käivitati vanas BIOS-režiimis. MAN-i saab paigaldada ainult UEFI-arvutitesse: taaskäivita ja vali UEFI alglaadimisvalik."

