msgid "Passphrase"
msgstr "Paroolifraas"

#: installer.rs:657
msgid "Confirm Passphrase"
msgstr "Kinnita paroolifraas"

#: installer.rs:659
msgid "Keep this passphrase safe"
msgstr "Hoia seda paroolifraasi kindlas kohas"

#: installer.rs:660
msgid "If it is lost, the data cannot be recovered by anyone. The kernel and boot files stay on a small unencrypted boot partition."
msgstr "Kui see kaob, ei saa keegi andmeid taastada. Tuum ja alglaadimisfailid jäävad väikesele krüptimata alglaadimissektsioonile."

#: installer.rs:732
msgid "The passphrase needs at least 8 characters."
msgstr "Paroolifraas peab olema vähemalt 8 märki."

#: installer.rs:734
msgid "The passphrases do not match."
msgstr "Paroolifraasid ei kattu."

